<title>Ghost OS Help</title>
<h1>Commands</h1>
<pre>
help              show command list
gui / desktop     show panels TUI
ls                list FAT12 root files
cat HOME.GHT      print a FAT12 file
browse HOME.GHT   render a .GHT page
calc 12*34        calculator
pmode             enter protected mode demo and halt
</pre>
